---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="AWS User Group Bandung"
	description="A clean starter for the AWS User Group Bandung community site."
>
	<section class="border-b border-border bg-background">
		<div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] max-w-6xl content-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="mb-5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-primary">
					Community starter
				</p>
				<h1 class="text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
					A fresh start for AWS builders in Bandung.
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground">
					This project has been reset to a focused foundation: a clear layout,
					simple navigation, local brand assets, and room to add events,
					articles, speakers, and sponsors when the community is ready.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
					<a
						href="#start"
						class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary px-6 text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground transition hover:bg-primary/90"
					>
						Start building
					</a>
					<a
						href="#about"
						class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border bg-background px-6 text-sm font-bold text-foreground transition hover:bg-muted"
					>
						See foundation
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="relative min-h-[360px] overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-black/5">
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_48%,hsl(var(--primary-hsl)/0.18)_48%_52%,transparent_52%)]"></div>
				<div class="relative grid h-full content-between">
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
						<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">
							Bandung
						</span>
						<img src="/android-chrome-192x192.png" alt="" class="h-12 w-12" />
					</div>
					<div>
						<p class="text-8xl font-black leading-none text-primary">01</p>
						<p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-lg font-semibold leading-7 text-foreground">
							One clean page. No inherited event data. No copied Jakarta content.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
						<span>Astro</span>
						<span>Tailwind</span>
						<span>Ready</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about" class="bg-muted/35 py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5">
			<div class="max-w-2xl">
				<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-primary">
					What remains
				</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">
					A small base that is easy to extend.
				</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Layout</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
						Shared document shell, header, footer, favicon, and responsive page
						widths.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Theme</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
						Tailwind v4 tokens, Amazon Ember fonts, and a restrained
						AWS-inspired color system.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Room to grow</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
						Add content collections, API functions, or React islands only when
						the new site needs them.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="start" class="bg-background py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5">
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8 sm:p-10">
				<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-primary">
					Next steps
				</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground">
					Build the Bandung site intentionally.
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground md:grid-cols-3">
					<p>1. Add real community copy and links.</p>
					<p>2. Introduce events or blog content when the structure is decided.</p>
					<p>3. Keep features small until there is a clear owner and workflow.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
